  "detail_text": "READ THE ATTACHED SOLICITATION DOCUMENT IN ITS ENTIRETY. YOU WILL NEED TO REQUEST THE SPECIFICATIONS VIA EMAIL AND SEND ALL PPIs TO THE CONTRACT SPECIALIST LISTED BELOW: Daniel Rocha; daniel.r.rocha2.civ@us.navy.mil Military Construction Project (MILCON) P732 Design-Bid-Build, Electrical Distribution System Upgrades (Gosport Substation Only) at Norfolk Naval Shipyard (NNSY) in Portsmouth, Virginia. AMENDMENT 0001 1. Revise the Solicitation 2. Add Site Visit Information 3. Add Award Fee Information and Award Fee CLIN 4. Answer PPIs The Following Attachments were added: Attachment N - Award Fee Plan Attachment O - SECNAV 5512 Attachment P - BLANK DBIDS or VISITOR REQUEST Attachment Q - Approved Identity Proofing Documents Attachment R - Criteria for Denying Access to Navy Installations AMENDMENT 0002 1. Revise the Solicitation 2. Answer PPIs AMENDMENT 0003 1. Add revised Specification \"01 30 00.00 22\" attachment 2. Answer PPIs 3. Add Site Visit Sign-in Roster AMENDMENT 0004 1. Revise the solicitation 2. Remove Project Labor Agreement Requirement (PLA) 3. Extend the proposal due date to 18 March 2026 AMENDMENT 0005 1. Extend the proposal due date 2. Revise the solicitation section 00 70 00 - Conditions of the Contract 3. Answer PPIs 4. Revise Clause 52.211-12 Liquidated Damages-Construction. 5. Revise Clause 52.211-10 Commencement, Prosecution, and Completion of Work. 6. Revise Factor 3 - Schedule 7. Revise Attachment G - Price Proposal Form 8. Revise Specifications 9. Revise Drawings THE PPI PERIOD IS NOT EXTENDED WITH THE SOLICITATION DUE DATE.",
